                "text": "Jennifer from Hillman: \u201cLosing our Medicaid coverage would be a hardship that would break\u00a0us, as we\u2019re on the brink of bankruptcy. If we had to cover my medical copays, I would have to choose between my blood thinners & iron treatments or keeping the lights on.\u201d",
