                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Important, and unwelcome news: Health insurance premiums in Michigan are set to spike in 2026 \u2013  up to a 17% increase for individuals, and an 11% increase for small businesses. Every Michigander should watch their health insurance very closely this fall.\n\nWith impending Medicaid and Obamacare cuts,  Michiganders are either at risk of losing their health care or paying significantly more.",
