                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I lost my mother to ovarian cancer in 2011 when she was 64, and my grandmother at age 39. Too many lack access to the genetic screening they need, and our bill takes steps to help by expanding Medicare\u2019s coverage of genetic testing and treatment. https://t.co/1pG07wdK9x",
