                "retweet_count": 44,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "530,000 Michiganders, including 275,000 in Republican-held Congressional Districts, are at risk of higher health care prices or losing their health care coverage because of President Trump.\n\nYet, House Republicans haven\u2019t been to work in straight 32 days. If they want to negotiate on health care, I am right here in the Capitol, waiting. Get yourself to Washington and join me in working to lower health care costs for Michiganders.\n\nI simply can\u2019t talk to Michiganders with a straight face if I don\u2019t fight for their health care. \n\nSo here are some of their stories \ud83e\uddf5",
